WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.235
Artificial intelligence

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:04.170
is the hottest new thing in technology

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:04.771
right now.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.139
But my next guest says

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.140
there's something else

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.009
we should be paying attention to.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.911
Quantum computing It is an emerging field

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.747
that aims to use the weird

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:16.149
properties of quantum particles

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.150
to make computers

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.085
that have vastly more processing

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.154
power than computers. Have today.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.789
And that could help us solve

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.058
all kinds of difficult problems.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.960
I spoke to the famous physicist

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.395
Michio Kaku,

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.329
who has a new book

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.399
called Quantum Supremacy How the Quantum

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.833
Computer Revolution

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.036
Will Change Everything.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.539
Michio Kaku, welcome again.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.107
Tell me what.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.843
What's your take on the A.I.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.179
chat bots chatbot

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.481
that everybody is so obsessed by now?

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.084
I think the media is hyperventilate

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:53.920
over the implications of these chat bots.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.256
First of all, they are productive.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.425
They're going to speed up the ability

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.226
to produce materials.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.327
It's going to be an advance

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.063
for society in general.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:03.496
However,

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.697
people are focusing

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.433
on the negative aspects

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.168
of chatbots as well

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:10.770
because people are afraid however,

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.572
what is a chat bot?

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.041
A chat bot is a glorified tape recorder.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.144
It takes snippets of what's on the web

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:21.247
created by a human Splices them together

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.949
and passages off

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:25.118
as if it created these things.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.853
And people are saying, Oh my God,

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.787
it's a human.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:28.388
It's human.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.123
Like the checkbox

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.491
simply rearranges

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.359
whatever on the Internet.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.094
Already,

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.095
it's a tape

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.163
recorder of a very advanced type

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:40.133
that is not understand truth.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.602
What is false

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.603
does not understand

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.005
slander versus reality.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:47.807
That has to be put in by a human

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.677
So the real shift

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:51.878
that you say is going to take

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.179
place is once

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.281
we get to quantum computing.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.749
We've gone through three

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.085
basic stages of computer revolution.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.186
First stage

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.121
was when we computed

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:01.721
with sticks,

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.657
stones, levers, gears, pulleys, string.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.126
That was the first stage,

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.560
the analog stage.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.529
Then comes World War Two.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.163
At that point,

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.965
we switched to electricity

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.100
and we switched to transistors,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.002
and they gave us the microchip

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:18.138
and the digital revolution. Of today.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:19.906
We're in stage two,

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.774
which is the ones and zeros.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.109
The bit, the bits and bytes.

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:23.643
That's right.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.378
Zeros and ones. Zeros and ones.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:27.881
But Mother Nature would laugh at us

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.115
because Mother Nature

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:30.950
does not use zeros and ones.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.418
Zeros and ones.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.554
Mother Nature computes on electrons,

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:35.955
electron waves,

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.724
waves that create molecule holes.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.692
And that's why we're now

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.461
entering stage three.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.596
Silicon Valley could become a Rust Belt

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.431
unless they get on the bandwagon.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:45.965
But, but.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.234
But would it be fair to say that

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.370
this the shift that you're describing.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.538
Quantum computing,

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:54.073
basically, we're now trying to mimic

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.976
what nature does because an electron

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:58.711
is not a particle,

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.480
it's a wave or it's sort of both.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.815
And that's where computing has to go.

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.251
By God, I think you got it.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.520
That's exactly what we're talking about.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.555
Because, for example,

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:10.290
take a look at a transistor.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.325
The transistor has two states up

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.260
and down, left and right.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.495
True and false.

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:16.996
So think of an atom

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:20.033
that spins either up or down to states.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.634
The digital revolution is

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.269
based on that idea.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.003
However,

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.973
a quantum computer can be at any angle.

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:28.141
Now, think about that.

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.976
There are infinitely more states

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:31.311
that you can create

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:33.546
if an electron is allowed to wobble

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:36.182
and point in any direction whatsoever.

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:38.384
Rather than up or down.

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:41.854
So quantum computing is computing

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:46.025
using not computer chips, but using these

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.461
waves or these.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.128
That's right.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:51.197
The various states of these waves,

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:53.600
these waves can vibrate in any direction.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:56.069
And there are simultaneous

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:58.738
so that it can actually calculate

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:00.907
two or three places at the same time.

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:03.543
So think of a mouse in a maze.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.044
A digital computer.

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:07.580
We calculate the trajectory of each mouse

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.449
at every joint,

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:10.416
at every place

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.417
where there's a decision

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:14.020
to be made in a maze that takes forever.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:15.455
Now, Quantum

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:17.457
Computer instantly analyzes

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:19.726
all possible modes,

00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:22.729
all possible trajectories simultaneously.

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:24.130
Now, that violates

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.832
common sense

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:27.233
that you cannot be two places

00:04:27.233 --> 00:04:28.668
at the same time.

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:30.903
Well, get with it.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.739
In the quantum theory,

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.341
you can be many places at the same time.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:37.343
And that's the power of

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:38.311
quantum computers.

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:39.279
What would it look like?

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:41.147
Would my laptop look the same?

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:42.715
When you look at a quantum computer,

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.250
it's like a chandelier.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.852
A gigantic device.

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.153
But the actual

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:48.821
the actual computation is done

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:50.256
at the very bottom.

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:51.991
What is this chandelier?

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:54.060
The chandelier is cooling pipes.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.827
Cooling pipes

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:55.862
to bring it down to near

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.063
absolute zero

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:58.731
where there's no vibrations.

00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:00.867
If somebody sneeze is a block away,

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.469
that could ruin your whole calculation.

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:06.306
And so you want everything to be frozen

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:07.740
near absolute zero.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.108
What I'm also struck by is

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:10.610
tell me if I'm wrong.

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.844
When you hear about all this

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:13.279
artificial intelligence

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:13.746
and the amount

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:15.081
of computing power

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:17.684
you need to produce this stuff

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:18.885
and the amount of energy

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.720
you need to run all these computers,

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:21.421
I always think, God,

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.823
the brain is very energy efficient.

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:24.724
We're able

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:26.059
to make all these calculations.

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:27.660
We don't need all this cooling

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.128
with somehow doing it

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:30.630
using much less energy

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.765
than these vast computers

00:05:32.765 --> 00:05:34.534
with all of their heat.

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:36.135
Mother Nature is still ahead of us.

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:36.836
Our brain

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:38.371
is the most complex object

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:40.173
in the known universe.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:41.808
We know of nothing in the universe

00:05:41.808 --> 00:05:43.810
more complex than the human brain.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.179
Which has 100 billion neurons,

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:47.347
each neuron

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:50.283
connected to 10,000 other neurons.

00:05:50.717 --> 00:05:53.119
And it's all done at room temperature.

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:54.854
And so we're playing catch up,

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.089
catch up to Mother Nature.

00:05:56.089 --> 00:05:58.391
And Mother Nature is quantum.

00:05:58.391 --> 00:05:59.759
And that's what we have to make.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:00.493
The transition

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:02.095
from digital computers

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:04.330
to quantum computers.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.331
And that will allow us

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:07.367
to calculate diseases.

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.368
For example, there

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:09.769
at the quantum level,

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:13.639
cancer, Parkinson's, Alzheimer's disease.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.041
These are diseases

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:16.442
at the molecular level.

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:18.678
We're powerless to cure these diseases

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:20.480
because we have to learn

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.248
the language of nature,

00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:24.384
which is the language of molecules and

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.053
and quantum electrons.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.621
Michio Kaku, always a pleasure

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:29.188
to talk to you.

